---
title: "Figure 7.2.13 - Semantic Search (RAG)"
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant OrchSvc as Orchestrator Service
    participant RetrievalSvc as Retrieval Service
    participant EmbeddingSvc as Embedding Service
    participant EmbeddingRepo as Embedding Repository (pgvector)
    participant TranscriptRepo as Transcript Repository
    participant MessageRepo as Message Repository
    participant DocStore as Document Store

    Note over RetrievalSvc: During simulation turn,<br/>need to find relevant context

    OrchSvc->>RetrievalSvc: Find context<br/>{query, sessionId}

    RetrievalSvc->>EmbeddingSvc: Generate query embedding
    Note over EmbeddingSvc: Use sentence transformer<br/>(e.g., all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
    EmbeddingSvc-->>RetrievalSvc: Query vector

    RetrievalSvc->>EmbeddingRepo: Vector similarity search
    Note over EmbeddingRepo: pgvector <-> operator<br/>Filter by namespace<br/>Limit to top-k (5-10)
    EmbeddingRepo-->>RetrievalSvc: Matching EmbeddingRow records<br/>{refType, refId, score}

    loop For each match
        alt refType = "TranscriptSegment"
            RetrievalSvc->>TranscriptRepo: Fetch segment content
            TranscriptRepo-->>RetrievalSvc: Segment text + metadata
        else refType = "Document"
            RetrievalSvc->>DocStore: Fetch document
            DocStore-->>RetrievalSvc: Document content
        else refType = "Message"
            RetrievalSvc->>MessageRepo: Fetch message
            MessageRepo-->>RetrievalSvc: Message content
        end
    end

    Note over RetrievalSvc: Assemble chunks with:<br/>- Source<br/>- Timestamp<br/>- Relevance score

    RetrievalSvc-->>OrchSvc: Retrieved context chunks

    Note over OrchSvc: Include in LLM prompt<br/>as grounding info

