title: "Figure 7.2.18 - Benchmark Tracking and Leaderboards"
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant FeedbackSvc as Feedback Service
    participant ScoreRepo as Score Repository
    participant BenchmarkSvc as Benchmark Service
    participant BenchmarkRepo as Benchmark Repository
    participant EventBus as Event Bus
    participant Dashboard as Admin Dashboard

    Note over FeedbackSvc: After scorecard generated

    FeedbackSvc->>BenchmarkSvc: Update benchmarks<br/>{scorecardId, orgId}

    BenchmarkSvc->>ScoreRepo: Retrieve new scorecard
    ScoreRepo-->>BenchmarkSvc: Scorecard data

    loop For each tracked metric
        Note over BenchmarkSvc: Metrics:<br/>- avg_score<br/>- discovery_questions<br/>- objection_handling<br/>- closing_effectiveness

        BenchmarkSvc->>ScoreRepo: Retrieve recent scorecards<br/>(team/org, time window)
        ScoreRepo-->>BenchmarkSvc: Historical scorecards

        Note over BenchmarkSvc: Calculate:<br/>- Rolling average<br/>- Median<br/>- Percentile

        BenchmarkSvc->>BenchmarkRepo: Update/Create Benchmark<br/>{orgId, metric, value, window}
        BenchmarkRepo-->>BenchmarkSvc: Benchmark updated
    end

    alt Threshold crossed
        Note over BenchmarkSvc: E.g., team average<br/>drops below target
        BenchmarkSvc->>EventBus: Emit benchmark.updated<br/>{orgId, metric, threshold}
    end

    Note over Dashboard: User views scorecard

    Dashboard->>BenchmarkRepo: Query benchmarks<br/>{orgId, metrics[]}
    BenchmarkRepo-->>Dashboard: Benchmark data

    Note over Dashboard: Display:<br/>- User's current score<br/>- Team average<br/>- Org average<br/>- Percentile ranking

    Note over Dashboard: Leaderboards:<br/>- Top performers by score<br/>- Most improved over time<br/>- Team comparison charts

